  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We need to make a Horn of Eternal Winter, and for that, young Wizard, you've got to gather Pure Loam from Lady Oriel and Everfrost Ice Fragments from Kazul Ironhelm. Bring them back to me when you've got them.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Greyrose_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfLydiaGreyrose_QST_84.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38172,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Frost Giants will surely listen to you now when you address them... but you'll still need to make them a suitable offering to summon the Rainbow Bridge. To bring it to Wizard City you must create a tool to summon them: a Horn of Eternal Winter. \\n",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Greyrose_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfLydiaGreyrose_QST_85.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38172,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I will help you with the first part: gathering the raw materials. First you need to get some Pure Loam from Lady Oriel, in Unicorn Way's Hedge Maze. Though she's no friend to the Frost Giants, she should be willing to give you some.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Greyrose_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfLydiaGreyrose_QST_86.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38172,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The next thing you'll need is a handful of Everfrost Ice Fragments from Colossus Boulevard. Kazul Ironhelm likely has some he can spare you... they're of no use to him. Return here when you've fetched those things, and I'll tell you what to do next. \\n",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Greyrose_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfLydiaGreyrose_QST_87.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38172,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
